ategory":"地方行政","official_name":"相","official_note":"相是漢代諸侯國的行政長官，由中央任命，負責輔佐諸侯王治理封國。在此上下文中，淮南王的相勸阻王響應吳楚七國之亂，並主動請纓為將，後率兵守城，轉而支持漢朝，顯示其關鍵的決策和軍事作用。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"其相曰","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"cc8e39d4-eb98-453b-a840-eab48a54bb72"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"將","official_note":"將指軍事將領，負責統率軍隊。在此上下文中，淮南王的相自願擔任將領，以率兵響應吳楚七國之亂，但後來轉而為漢朝守城，體現其軍事指揮角色。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"臣願爲將","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"b7c7411d-fbde-4b7c-89b7-17033b528979"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"曲城侯","official_note":"曲城侯是漢代的侯爵封號，屬於爵位而非具體官職，但在此上下文中，漢朝派遣曲城侯率兵救援淮南，顯示其作為軍事指揮官的角色。","official_rank":"侯爵","source_snippet":"漢亦使曲城侯將兵救淮南","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"e4ce1913-d734-41b0-9ab7-7b0d96b1861c"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-179,"link_death_year":-122,"link_td_description":"刘安，汉高祖刘邦之孙，淮南王刘长之子，西汉淮南王，现留名著《淮南子》，是古代科学思想的总合代表著作。","link_td_id":"Q10000908","link_td_number_id":433673,"people_name":"淮南王","people_name_jianti_auto":"淮南王","people_xingming":"刘安","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8f31a8fa-db0e-11ef-a4d2-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘安]"},{"people_name":"曲城侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"曲城侯","people_xingming":"捷","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"8f31a901-db0e-11ef-99de-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","resolved_place_entity_id":32,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f31a8fb-db0e-11ef-8239-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","resolved_place_entity_id":138,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8f31a8fc-db0e-11ef-8636-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","resolved_place_entity_id":32,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8f31a8fd-db0e-11ef-b6ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮","resolved_place_entity_id":108,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8f31a8fe-db0e-11ef-867d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","resolved_place_entity_id":32,"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8f31a8ff-db0e-11ef-831b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8f31a900-db0e-11ef-a01c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8f31a902-db0e-11ef-8f50-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮","resolved_place_entity_id":108,"start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"8f31a903-db0e-11ef-b2c7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"七国之乱","tongjian_id":"war_N0571"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事","内政"],"content":"6初，吳、楚七國反，吳使者至淮南，淮南王欲發兵應之。其相曰：「王必欲應吳，臣願爲將。」王乃屬之。相已將兵，因城守，不聽王而爲漢，漢亦使曲城侯將兵救淮南，以故得完。","content_fanyi":"当初，吴、楚七国反叛，吴王刘濞的使者来到淮南国，淮南王刘安打算发兵响应吴王。淮南王的丞相说：“大王如果一定要响应吴王，我愿意担任将领。”淮南王便把军队交给他指挥。丞相掌握军权后，就据城防守，不听从淮南王，反而为汉朝廷效力；汉朝廷也派曲城侯率军救援淮南国，淮南王因此得以保全。","content_jianti_auto":"6初，吴、楚七国反，吴使者至淮南，淮南王欲发兵应之。其相曰：「王必欲应吴，臣愿为将。」王乃属之。相已将兵，因城守，不听王而为汉，汉亦使曲城侯将兵救淮南，以故得完。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，赤眉、黄巾之乱，袁、曹、公孙、韩、马之争，中国亦尝鼎沸...","context_before":"...而不息。使竞在中国而无待于彼，不示以弱而绝其相陵之萌，则","source_end_index":219,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6171c44a-cea3-4bcf-85da-62b6536e04b9","source_start_index":215,"source_text":"七国之反"}],"title":"一 借夷狄为竞而晋亡"},{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，骨肉喋血而不容已。然则人主即欲建本支以镇天下，亦无如节...","context_before":"至于汉，六国废，韩、彭诛，而欲以周道行之，则","source_end_index":32,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f3ee0225-6a27-4ce3-8030-6ab9e0654fd1","source_start_index":22,"source_text":"七国、衡山、淮南之祸"}],"title":"二 宗室人才之盛，未有如唐者"}],"id":1276,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8f31a8e9-db0e-11ef-987f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"E