。庐江王以边越，数使使相交，徙为衡山王，王江北。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1277,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8f31a904-db0e-11ef-8770-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"四年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"四年","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8f2fd446-db0e-11ef-8801-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（戊子、前一五三）","year_int":-153},"message":"success","success":true}